"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-128-guice:p020","chapter_id":"c-shiji-128-guice"},{"id":"c-shiji-128-guice:m021-0027","start":27,"end":29,"surface":"衛平","kind":"person","person_id":"p27_7v5_rgy","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-128-guice:p021","chapter_id":"c-shiji-128-guice"},{"id":"c-shiji-128-guice:m021-0035","start":35,"end":36,"surface":"平","kind":"person","person_id":"p27_7v5_rgy","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-128-guice:p021","chapter_id":"c-shiji-128-guice"},{"id":"c-shiji-128-guice:m021-0058","start":58,"end":59,"surface":"平","kind":"person","person_id":"p27_7v5_rgy","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-128-guice:p021","chapter_id":"c-shiji-128-guice"}],"relations":[],"title_holdings":[{"id":"th-shiji128-003","person_id":"p27_7v5_rgy","title":"博士","kind":"office","mode":"attestation","status":"source_attested","evidence":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-128-guice","source_id":"s-shiji128-guice","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-128-guice:p012","quote":"宋元王二年，江使神龜使於河，至於泉陽，漁者豫且舉網得而囚之。置之籠中。夜半，龜來見夢於宋元王曰：「我為江使於河，而幕網當吾路。泉陽豫且得我，我不能去。身在患中，莫可告語。王有德義，故來告訴。」元王惕然而悟。乃召博士衛平而問之曰：「今寡人夢見一丈夫，延頸而長頭，衣玄繡之衣而乘輜車，來見夢於寡人曰：『我為江使於河，而幕網當吾路。泉陽豫且得我，我不能去。身在患中，莫可告語。王有德義，故來告訴。』是何物也？」衛平乃援式而起，仰天而視月之光，觀斗所指，定日處鄉。規矩為輔，副以權衡。四維已定，八卦相望。視其吉凶，介蟲先見。乃對元王曰：「今昔壬子，宿在牽牛。河水大會，鬼神相謀。漢正南北，江河固期，南風新至，江使先來。白雲壅漢，萬物盡留。斗柄指日，使者當囚。玄服而乘輜車，其名為龜。王急使人問而求之。」王曰：「善。」"}],"attestations":[{"id":"th-shiji128-003:a001","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-128-guice:p012","start":105,"end":107,"surface":"博士","person_mention_id":"c-shiji-128-guice:m012-0107","usage":"narrative","date_expression":null}],"effective_period":{"start":{"status":"unknown","date_expression":null,"evidence":[]},"end":{"status":"unknown","date_expression":null,"evidence":[]}},"interpretation_note":"按原句官爵用稱記錄，不推實任年月；明示為郎或號為武王保存來源事件，未知起訖保持未知，死亡不自動終止官爵。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"},{"id":"th-shiji128-008","person_id":"p27_7v5_rgy","title":"相","kind":"office","mode":"attestation","status":"source_attested","evidence":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-128-guice","source_id":"s-shiji128-guice","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-128-guice:p019","quote":"元王大悅而喜。於是元王向日而謝，再拜而受。擇日齋戒，甲乙最良。乃刑白雉，及與驪羊；以血灌龜，於壇中央。以刀剝之，身全不傷。脯酒禮之，橫其腹腸。荊支卜之，必制其創。理達於理，文相錯迎。使工占之，所言盡當。邦福重寶，聞于傍鄉。殺牛取帮，被鄭之桐。草木畢分，化為甲兵。戰勝攻取，莫如元王。元王之時，衛平相宋，宋國最彊，龜之力也。"}],"attestations":[{"id":"th-shiji128-008:a001","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-128-guice:p019","start":148,"end":149,"surface":"相","person_mention_id":"c-shiji-128-guice:m019-0146","usage":"narrative","date_expression":null}],"effective_period":{"start":{"status":"unknown","date_expression":null,"evidence":[]},"end":{"status":"unknown","date_expression":null,"evidence":[]}},"interpretation_note":"按原句官爵用稱記錄，不推實任年月；明示為郎或號為武王保存來源事件，未知起訖保持未知，死亡不自動終止官爵。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"}],"address_assertions":[],"table_occurrences":[],"date_normalizations":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"preferred_birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-shiji-128-guice:p012","text":"宋元王二年，江使神龜使於河，至於泉陽，漁者豫且舉網得而囚之。置之籠中。夜半，龜來見夢於宋元王曰：「我為江使於河，而幕網當吾路。泉陽豫且得我，我不能去。身在患中，莫可告語。王有德義，故來告訴。」元王惕然而悟。乃召博士衛平而問之曰：「今寡人夢見一丈夫，延頸而長頭，衣玄繡之衣而乘輜車，來見夢於寡人曰：『我為江使於河，而幕網當吾路。泉陽豫且得我，我不能去。身在患中，莫可告語。王有德義，故來告訴。』是何物也？」衛平乃援式而起，仰天而視月之光，觀斗所指，定日處鄉。規矩為輔，副以權衡。四維已定，八卦相望。視其吉凶，介蟲先見。乃對元王曰：「今昔壬子，宿在牽牛。河水大會，鬼神相謀。漢正南北，江河固期，南風新至，江使先來。白雲壅漢，萬物盡留。斗柄指日，使者當囚。玄服而乘輜車，其名為龜。王急使人問而求之。」王曰：「善。」","annotation_status":"in_progress","text_layer":"witness_appended_chu_note","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-128-guice:m012-0000","start":0,"end":3,"surface":"宋元王","kind":"person","person_id":"a4t_7hv_0s6","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-128-guice:m012-0008","start":8,"end":10,"surface":"神龜","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved"},{"id":"c-shiji-128-guice:m012-0021","start":21,"end":23,"surface":"豫且","kind":"person","person_id":"uiq_fxy_s78","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-128-guice:m012-0043","start":43,"end":46,"surface":"宋元王","kind":"person","person_id":"a4t_7hv_0s6","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-128-guice:m012-0065","start":65,"end":67,"surface":"豫且","kind":"person","person_id":"uiq_fxy_s78","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-128-guice:m012-0096","start":96,"end":98,"surface":"元王","kind":"person","person_id":"a4t_7hv_0s6","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-128-guice:m012-0107","start":107,"end":109,"surface":"衛平","kind":"person","person_id":"p27_7v5_rgy","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-128-guice:m012-0165","start":165,"end":167,"surface":"豫且","kind":"person","person_id":"uiq_fxy_s78","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-128-guice:m012-0202","start":202,"end":204,"surface":"衛平","kind":"person","person_id":"p27_7v5_rgy","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-128-guice:m012-0260","start":260,"end":262,"surface":"元王","kind":"person","person_id":"a4t_7hv_0s6","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-128-guice","book_id":"b-shiji-128","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji128-guice"},{"id":"c-shiji-128-guice:p014","text":"使者載行，出於泉陽之門。正晝無見，風雨晦冥。雲蓋其上，五采青黃；雷雨并起，風將而行。入於端門，見於東箱。身如流水，潤澤有光。望見元王，延頸而前，三步而止，縮頸而卻，復其故處。元王見而怪之，問衛平曰：「龜見寡人，延頸而前，以何望也？縮頸而復，是何當也？」衛平對曰：「龜在患中，而終昔囚，王有德義，使人活之。今延頸而前，以當謝也，縮頸而卻，欲亟去也。」元王曰：「善哉！神至如此乎，不可久留；趣駕送龜，勿令失期。」衛平對曰：「龜者是天下之寶也，先得此龜者為天子，且十言十當，十戰十勝。生於深淵，長於黃土。知天之道，明於上古。游三千歲，不出其域。安平靜正，動不用力。壽蔽天地，莫知其極。與物變化，四時變色。居而自匿，伏而不食。春倉夏黃，秋白冬黑。明於陰陽，審於刑德。先知利害，察於禍福，以言而當，以戰而勝，王能寶之，諸侯盡服。王勿遣也，以安社稷。」元王曰：「龜甚神靈，降于上天，陷於深淵。在患難中。以我為賢。德厚而忠信，故來告寡人。寡人若不遣也，是漁者也。漁者利其肉，寡人貪其力，下為不仁，上為無德。君臣無禮，何從有福？寡人不忍，柰何勿遣！」衛平對曰：「不然。臣聞盛德不報，重寄不歸；天與不受，天奪之寶。今龜周流天下，還復其所，上至蒼天，下薄泥涂。還遍九州，未嘗愧辱，無所稽留。今至泉陽，漁者辱而囚之。王雖遣之，江河必怒，務求報仇。自以為侵，因神與謀。淫雨不霽，水不可治。若為枯旱，風而揚埃，蝗蟲暴生，百姓失時。王行仁義，其罰必來。此無佗故，其祟在龜。後雖悔之，豈有及哉！王勿遣也。」","annotation_status":"in_progress","text_layer":"witness_appended_chu_note","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-128-guice:m014-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"使者","kind":"person","person_id":"ywc_x00_1rh","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-128-guice:m014-0064","start":64,"end":66,"surface":"元王","kind":"person","person_id":"a4t_7hv_0s6","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-128-guice:m014-0087","start":87,"end":89,"surface":"元王","kind":"person","person_id":"a4t_7hv_0s6","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-128-guice:m014-0095","start":95,"end":97,"surface":"衛平","kind":"person","person_id":"p27_7v5_rgy","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-128-guice:m014-0126","start":126,"end":128,"surface":"衛平","kind":"person","person_id":"p27_7v5_rgy","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-128-guice:m014-0142","start":142,"end":143,"surface":"王","kind":"person","person_id":"a4t_7hv_0s6","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-128-guice:m014-0174","start":174,"end":176,"surface":"元王","kind":"person","person_id":"a4t_7hv_0s6","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-128-guice:m014-0204","start":204,"end":206,"surface":"衛平","kind":"person","person_id":"p27_7v5_rgy","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-128-guice:m014-0349","start":349,"end":350,"surface":"王","kind":"person","person_id":"a4t_7hv_0s6","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-128-guice:m014-0359","start":359,"end":360,"surface":"王","kind":"person","person_id":"a4t_7hv_0s6","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-128-guice:m014-0370","start":370,"end":372,"surface":"元王","kind":"person","person_id":"a4t_7hv_0s6","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-128-guice:m014-0467","start":467,"end":469,"surface":"衛平","kind":"person","person_id":"p27_7v5_rgy","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-128-guice:m014-0547","start":547,"end":548,"surface":"王","kind":"person","person_id":"a4t_7hv_0s6","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-128-guice:m014-0602","start":602,"end":603,"surface":"王","kind":"person","person_id":"a4t_7hv_0s6","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-128-guice:m014-0632","start":632,"end":633,"surface":"王","kind":"person","person_id":"a4t_7hv_0s6","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-128-guice","book_id":"b-shiji-128","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji128-guice"},{"id":"c-shiji-128-guice:p016","text":"衛平對曰：「不然，王其無患。天地之閒，累石為山。高而不壞，地得為安。故云物或危而顧安，或輕而不可遷；人或忠信而不如誕謾，或醜惡而宜大官，或美好佳麗而為眾人患。非神聖人，莫能盡言。春秋冬夏，或暑或寒。寒暑不和，賊氣相奸。同歲異節，其時使然。故令春生夏長，秋收冬藏。或為仁義，或為暴彊。暴彊有鄉，仁義有時。萬物盡然，不可勝治。大王聽臣，臣請悉言之。天出五色，以辨白黑。地生五穀，以知善惡。人民莫知辨也，與禽獸相若。谷居而穴處，不知田作。天下禍亂，陰陽相錯。悤悤疾疾，通而不相擇。妖孽數見，傳為單薄。聖人別其生，使無相獲。禽獸有牝牡，置之山原；鳥有雌雄，布之林澤；有介之蟲，置之谿谷。故牧人民，為之城郭，內經閭術，外為阡陌。夫妻男女，賦之田宅，列其室屋。為之圖籍，別其名族。立官置吏，勸以爵祿。衣以桑麻，養以五穀。耕之耰之，鉏之耨之。口得所嗜，目得所美，身受其利。以是觀之，非彊不至。故曰田者不彊，囷倉不盈；商賈不彊，不得其贏；婦女不彊，布帛不精；官御不彊，其勢不成；大將不彊，卒不使令；侯王不彊，沒世無名。故云彊者，事之始也，分之理也，物之紀也。所求於彊，無不有也。王以為不然，王獨不聞玉櫝隻雉，出於昆山；明月之珠，出於四海；鐫石拌蚌，傳賣於市；聖人得之，以為大寶。大寶所在，乃為天子。今王自以為暴，不如拌蚌於海也；自以為彊，不過鐫石於昆山也。取者無咎，寶者無患。今龜使來抵網，而遭漁者得之，見夢自言，是國之寶也，王何憂焉。」","annotation_status":"in_progress","text_layer":"witness_appended_chu_note","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-128-guice:m016-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"衛平","kind":"person","person_id":"p27_7v5_rgy","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-128-guice","book_id":"b-shiji-128","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji128-guice"},{"id":"c-shiji-128-guice:p018","text":"衛平對曰：「不然。河雖神賢，不如崑崙之山；江之源理，不如四海，而人尚奪取其寶，諸侯爭之，兵革為起。小國見亡，大國危殆，殺人父兄，虜人妻子，殘國滅廟，以爭此寶。戰攻分爭，是暴彊也。故云取之以暴彊而治以文理，無逆四時，必親賢士；與陰陽化，鬼神為使；通於天地，與之為友。諸侯賓服，民眾殷喜。邦家安寧，與世更始。湯武行之，乃取天子；春秋著之，以為經紀。王不自稱湯武，而自比桀紂。桀紂為暴彊也，固以為常。桀為瓦室，紂為象郎。徵絲灼之，務以費（民）［氓］。賦斂無度，殺戮無方。殺人六畜，以韋為囊。囊盛其血，與人縣而射之，與天帝爭彊。逆亂四時，先百鬼嘗。諫者輒死，諛者在傍。聖人伏匿，百姓莫行。天數枯旱，國多妖祥。螟蟲歲生，五穀不成。民不安其處，鬼神不享。飄風日起，正晝晦冥。日月并蝕，滅息無光。列星奔亂，皆絕紀綱。以是觀之，安得久長！雖無湯武，時固當亡。故湯伐桀，武王剋紂，其時使然。乃為天子，子孫續世；終身無咎，後世稱之，至今不已。是皆當時而行，見事而彊，乃能成其帝王。今龜，大寶也，為聖人使，傳之賢（士）［王］。不用手足，雷電將之；風雨送之，流水行之。侯王有德，乃得當之。今王有德而當此寶，恐不敢受；王若遣之，宋必有咎。後雖悔之，亦無及已。」","annotation_status":"in_progress","text_layer":"witness_appended_chu_note","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-128-guice:m018-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"衛平","kind":"person","person_id":"p27_7v5_rgy","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-128-guice:m018-0152","start":152,"end":153,"surface":"湯","kind":"person","person_id":"7z7_4p3_g9m","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-128-guice:m018-0153","start":153,"end":154,"surface":"武","kind":"person","person_id":"4mt_tfo_obl","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-128-guice:m018-0176","start":176,"end":177,"surface":"湯","kind":"person","person_id":"7z7_4p3_g9m","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-128-guice:m018-0177","start":177,"end":178,"surface":"武","kind":"person","person_id":"4mt_tfo_obl","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-128-guice:m018-0182","start":182,"end":183,"surface":"桀","kind":"person","person_id":"jyn_w3z_sqq","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-128-guice:m018-0183","start":183,"end":184,"surface":"紂","kind":"person","person_id":"ouo_jje_54i","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-128-guice:m018-0185","start":185,"end":186,"surface":"桀","kind":"person","person_id":"jyn_w3z_sqq","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-128-guice:m018-0186","start":186,"end":187,"surface":"紂","kind":"person","person_id":"ouo_jje_54i","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-128-guice:m018-0197","start":197,"end":198,"surface":"桀","kind":"person","person_id":"jyn_w3z_sqq","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-128-guice:m018-0202","start":202,"end":203,"surface":"紂","kind":"person","person_id":"ouo_jje_54i","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-128-guice:m018-0255","start":255,"end":257,"surface":"天帝","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved"},{"id":"c-shiji-128-guice:m018-0363","start":363,"end":364,"surface":"湯","kind":"person","person_id":"7z7_4p3_g9m","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-128-guice:m018-0364","start":364,"end":365,"surface":"武","kind":"person","person_id":"4mt_tfo_obl","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-128-guice:m018-0372","start":372,"end":373,"surface":"湯","kind":"person","person_id":"7z7_4p3_g9m","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-128-guice:m018-0374","start":374,"end":375,"surface":"桀","kind":"person","person_id":"jyn_w3z_sqq","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-128-guice:m018-0376","start":376,"end":378,"surface":"武王","kind":"person","person_id":"4mt_tfo_obl","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-128-guice:m018-0379","start":379,"end":380,"surface":"紂","kind":"person","person_id":"ouo_jje_54i","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-128-guice","book_id":"b-shiji-128","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji128-guice"},{"id":"c-shiji-128-guice:p019","text":"元王大悅而喜。於是元王向日而謝，再拜而受。擇日齋戒，甲乙最良。乃刑白雉，及與驪羊；以血灌龜，於壇中央。以刀剝之，身全不傷。脯酒禮之，橫其腹腸。荊支卜之，必制其創。理達於理，文相錯迎。使工占之，所言盡當。邦福重寶，聞于傍鄉。殺牛取帮，被鄭之桐。草木畢分，化為甲兵。戰勝攻取，莫如元王。元王之時，衛平相宋，宋國最彊，龜之力也。","annotation_status":"in_progress","text_layer":"witness_appended_chu_note","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-128-guice:m019-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"元王","kind":"person","person_id":"a4t_7hv_0s6","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-128-guice:m019-0009","start":9,"end":11,"surface":"元王","kind":"person","person_id":"a4t_7hv_0s6","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-128-guice:m019-0138","start":138,"end":140,"surface":"元王","kind":"person","person_id":"a4t_7hv_0s6","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-128-guice:m019-0141","start":141,"end":143,"surface":"元王","kind":"person","person_id":"a4t_7hv_0s6","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-128-guice:m019-0146","start":146,"end":148,"surface":"衛平","kind":"person","person_id":"p27_7v5_rgy","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-128-guice","book_id":"b-shiji-128","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji128-guice"},{"id":"c-shiji-128-guice:p020","text":"故云神至能見夢於元王，而不能自出漁者之籠。身能十言盡當，不能通使於河，還報於江，賢能令人戰勝攻取，不能自解於刀鋒，免剝刺之患。聖能先知亟見，而不能令衛平無言。言事百全，至身而攣；當時不利，又焉事賢！賢者有恒常，士有適然。是故明有所不見，聽有所不聞；人雖賢，不能左畫方，右畫圓；日月之明，而時蔽於浮雲。羿名善射，不如雄渠、蜂門；禹名為辯智，而不能勝鬼神。地柱折，天故毋椽，又柰何責人於全？孔子聞之曰：「神龜知吉凶，而骨直空枯。日為德而君於天下，辱於三足之烏。月為刑而相佐，見食於蝦蟆。猬辱於鵲，騰蛇之神而殆於即且。竹外有節理，中直空虛；松柏為百木長，而守門閭。日辰不全，故有孤虛。黃金有疵，白玉有瑕。事有所疾，亦有所徐。物有所拘，亦有所據。罔有所數，亦有所疏。人有所貴，亦有所不如。何可而適乎？物安可全乎？天尚不全，故世為屋，不成三瓦而陳之，以應之天。天下有階，物不全乃生也。」","annotation_status":"in_progress","text_layer":"witness_appended_chu_note","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-128-guice:m020-0008","start":8,"end":10,"surface":"元王","kind":"person","person_id":"a4t_7hv_0s6","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-128-guice:m020-0074","start":74,"end":76,"surface":"衛平","kind":"person","person_id":"p27_7v5_rgy","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-128-guice:m020-0150","start":150,"end":151,"surface":"羿","kind":"person","person_id":"8fm_xgr_9dc","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-128-guice:m020-0157","start":157,"end":159,"surface":"雄渠","kind":"person","person_id":"pwg_7ka_397","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-128-guice:m020-0160","start":160,"end":162,"surface":"蜂門","kind":"person","person_id":"1ux_z2g_fxh","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-128-guice:m020-0163","start":163,"end":164,"surface":"禹","kind":"person","person_id":"fw5_vd1_4xy","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-128-guice:m020-0193","start":193,"end":195,"surface":"孔子","kind":"person","person_id":"44y_n3n_ovn","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-128-guice:m020-0200","start":200,"end":202,"surface":"神龜","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-128-guice","book_id":"b-shiji-128","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji128-guice"},{"id":"c-shiji-128-guice:p021","text":"褚先生曰：漁者舉網而得神龜，龜自見夢宋元王，元王召博士衛平告以夢龜狀，平運式，定日月，分衡度，視吉凶，占龜與物色同，平諫王留神龜以為國重寶，美矣。古者筮必稱龜者，以其令名，所從來久矣。余述而為傳。","annotation_status":"in_progress","text_layer":"witness_appended_chu_note","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-128-guice:m021-0000","start":0,"end":3,"surface":"褚先生","kind":"person","person_id":"2xw_63z_xh9","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-128-guice:m021-0011","start":11,"end":13,"surface":"神龜","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved"},{"id":"c-shiji-128-guice:m021-0018","start":18,"end":21,"surface":"宋元王","kind":"person","person_id":"a4t_7hv_0s6","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-128-guice:m021-0022","start":22,"end":24,"surface":"元王","kind":"person","person_id":"a4t_7hv_0s6","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-128-guice:m021-0027","start":27,"end":29,"surface":"衛平","kind":"person","person_id":"p27_7v5_rgy","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-128-guice:m021-0035","start":35,"end":36,"surface":"平","kind":"person","person_id":"p27_7v5_rgy","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-128-guice:m021-0058","start":58,"end":59,"surface":"平","kind":"person","person_id":"p27_7v5_rgy","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-128-guice:m021-0062","start":62,"end":64,"surface":"神龜","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-128-guice","book_id":"b-shiji-128","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji128-guice"}],"sources":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-128-guice","work_id":"w-shiji","book_id":"b-shiji-128","source_id":"s-shiji128-guice","source":{"title":"史記／卷128","provider":"維基文庫","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/史記/卷128","permalink":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?title=史記/卷128&oldid=7904127","revision_id":7904127,"accessed_on":"2026-10-11","extent":"固定修訂全文95段，篇文5段、褚先生補文89段、索隱述贊1段。","image_verified":false,"rights":"古代原文；數位轉錄依維基文庫CC BY-SA 4.0，保留署名及固定版本。","license_url":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","normalization":{"character_conversion":{},"editorial_readings":[],"extraction_note":"去header2、wikipedia導覽模板與現代節標；保留原字及（民）［氓］等來源校讀括號，未核影像。","note":"來源笔與帮字面疑訛；最近五個修訂皆有，不擅校改。萬畢石朱方、陰兢及周太子歷待校。"}}}],"time_policy":{"unknown_is_not_unbounded":true,"attestation_is_not_tenure":true,"date_expressions_are_not_normalized":false,"date_normalization_coverage":"partial","normalized_year_numbering":"astronomical"}}
